@startuml BLE_System_Architecture
title HealthNYou BLE Chat - System Hierarchy (계층 구조)

package "Flutter Layer (Dart)" {
    [Chat UI] as UI
    [ChatController] as Controller
    note right of Controller : 비즈니스 로직 및 상태 관리
}

package "Bridge Layer (Platform Channels)" {
    interface "MethodChannel" as MC
    interface "EventChannels" as EC
    
    note right of MC : 명령 전달 (Flutter -> Native)\n- startScan\n- connect\n- sendMessage
    note right of EC : 데이터 스트림 (Native -> Flutter)\n- scan_results\n- connection_state\n- messages
}

package "Native Layer (iOS/Android)" {
    component "AppDelegate / MainActivity" as EntryPoint
    
    node "BLE Logic" {
        [BleCentralManager] as Central
        [BlePeripheralManager] as Peripheral
    }

    database "CoreBluetooth / Android BLE" as OS_BLE
}

UI --> Controller : 유저 입력
Controller --> MC : invokeMethod()
Controller <.. EC : stream.listen()

MC ==> EntryPoint
EntryPoint --> Central : Route Calls
EntryPoint --> Peripheral : Route Calls

Central --> OS_BLE : Scan / Connect / Write
Peripheral --> OS_BLE : Advertise / Notify

Central ..> EC : Send Events
Peripheral ..> EC : Send Events

@enduml

@startuml BLE_Service_Scenario
title HealthNYou BLE Chat - Connection & Chat Scenario

actor "User A (Central)" as UserA
participant "Device A\n(Flutter & Native)" as DevA
participant "Device B\n(Flutter & Native)" as DevB
actor "User B (Peripheral)" as UserB

== 초기화 및 모드 설정 ==
UserB -> DevB : 채팅방 개설 (Peripheral 모드)
DevB -> DevB : startPeripheral()\n- Advertising (UUID: FF01)\n- LocalName: HealthNYou-Chat

UserA -> DevA : 기기 찾기 (Central 모드)
DevA -> DevA : startScan()
DevA -> DevA : 주변 기기 감지\n(FF01 서비스 확인)
DevA -> UserA : 검색된 기기 목록 표시

== 연결 프로세스 (Connection) ==
UserA -> DevA : Device B 선택 및 연결 요청
DevA -> DevB : Connect 요청
DevB -> DevB : 연결 수락 (Central 구독 감지)
DevA -> DevA : 서비스(FF01) 및\n특성(FF02) 탐색
DevA -> DevB : Notify 활성화 (구독 요청)

DevA -> UserA : 연결 성공 (채팅 화면 이동)
DevB -> UserB : 연결 성공 (채팅 화면 이동)

== 메시지 전송 (Chatting) ==
note over DevA, DevB : Service UUID: FF01 / Char UUID: FF02

group Message: A -> B (Write Without Response)
    UserA -> DevA : "안녕하세요" 입력
    DevA -> DevB : Characteristic Write (FF02)
    DevB -> DevB : onCharacteristicWriteRequest
    DevB -> UserB : 메시지 표시 ("안녕하세요")
end

group Message: B -> A (Notify / Update Value)
    UserB -> DevB : "반갑습니다" 입력
    DevB -> DevA : Update Characteristic Value (FF02)
    DevA -> DevA : onCharacteristicChanged
    DevA -> UserA : 메시지 표시 ("반갑습니다")
end

== 연결 종료 (Disconnection) ==
UserA -> DevA : 채팅 종료 (뒤로가기)
DevA -> DevB : 연결 해제 요청
DevB -> DevB : 구독 해제 감지
DevB -> UserB : 상대방 나감 알림

@enduml